Package: com.wmua1.myjb.checkm8
Name: myJB Loader (checkm8)
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: myJB container loader (checkm8: palera1n 15+, checkra1n 12-14)
 Rootless payload (iphoneos-arm64): myjb_loader.dylib + plist into
 /var/jb/usr/lib/TweakInject for ElleKit. Rootful payload (iphoneos-arm,
 checkra1n 12-14): loader at /usr/lib/myjb_loader.dylib (the path Amethyst
 base_hook dlopens); postinst mirrors it into
 /Library/MobileSubstrate/DynamicLibraries or /usr/lib/TweakInject only
 when that engine is actually installed, and never creates /var/jb on
 rootful (anti-JB SDKs abort on that path alone). Creates the
 container/staging directories and generates the device key (kdev).
 Respring after installing.
Maintainer: wmua1
Author: wmua1
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 12.0)
Tag: purpose::extension
